{"id":"n85178-1-9","stage":5,"title":"행인 · 行人","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85178-1-9-1","ko":"길을 가는데 갑자기 행인이 나를 불러 세우는 거야.","zh":"我正在走路，突然有个路人把我叫住了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"길을","meaning":"路，路途","explanation":"길：路，路途；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"3","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길을","audio":"/audio/a41fdccc5780433c53cc.mp3"}},{"text":"가는데","meaning":"走","explanation":"가다：走；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"13","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가는데","audio":"/audio/769c4e4621c06eaf653d.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子。","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"행인이","meaning":"行人","explanation":"행인：行人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"행인","audio":"/audio/fa341a65ad81c01eff4e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85178","senseId":"1","lemma":"행인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"행인이","audio":"/audio/6ef19a22612241e3c6cf.mp3"}},{"text":"나를","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나를","audio":"/audio/4225b1c78642e45b4068.mp3"}},{"text":"불러","meaning":"叫","explanation":"부르다：叫；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"1","lemma":"부르다","ori